\title{CodingManageR: Multi-User Qualitative Coding Portal and Training Manager}
\description{
Provides a multi-user R Shiny web application and coder training portal for
qualitative text coding across ordinal scales. Supports local SQLite
databases for single-user desktop sessions as well as pooled MySQL/MariaDB
connections for Open Source Shiny Server deployments.
}
\details{
Key capabilities include:
\itemize{
\item Sixteen inter-rater reliability and agreement metrics computed via \code{aifeducation}
\item Stratified gold-standard training pools across all ordinal scale levels
\item Live field coding with per-user source and scale permissions
\item Consolidated master CSV exports and schema-validated CSV imports
\item On-demand interactive Getting Started spotlight tutorial with role-aware tracks
\item Bilingual (German/English) localization with automatic browser detection
}
